1. What would we expect to see if some customer types need assisted follow-up?
2. What evidence would instead support that card or online activation frictio=
n delays use?
3. How do we rule out that first useful activity varies by branch?

This has returned because the previous answer was useful but not strong enoug=
h to become a standing rule. Use July 2023 as the new evidence point rather t=
han recycling the earlier conclusion. Please work towards where branch coachi=
ng or onboarding process changes are needed. A useful output would be a model=
